WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:08.500
Store these weapons securely. Not a single blade is to leave the armory without my personal seal.

00:09.000 --> 00:15.500
Rest assured, Your Highness! My men guard the gates day and night—not even a sparrow could fly past us unnoticed!

00:16.000 --> 00:23.000
Tonight is the Emperor's grand banquet in the palace. We must ensure every preparation is beyond reproach.
